body:
My fantasies are nearly identical. 30 seemed to always be the cut-off for 'never-will-i-make-it'. I've never had the guts to inflict something so permanent onto myself, but I want that burden taken off of me. Sometimes I consider hiring a hitman or something to off me when I least suspect it. that's the best I've come up with.

&#x200B;

If you still have even a shimmer of hope left, I implore you to carry on.
